# Path algebra of a finite quiver has a unit
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Remark2.8.5"
number := false
%%%
**Remark 2.8.5.** It is easy to see that if $`Q` is a finite set then $`\sum_{i \in I} p_i = 1`, so $`P_Q` is an algebra with unit.
